+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-4862-ROTATED-TARGET,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-4862-REPRODUCTION-GATE,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-4862-STABLE-ARTIFACT.
